<item ID="1789651344" Creator="tbuddy" proto="pConcept" >
<attribute name="BorisId" >grok-bot/mapping</attribute>
<attribute name="BorisParent" >grok-bot</attribute>
<attribute name="Created" >2026-09-17T09:21:46-04:00</attribute>
<attribute name="ExportClass" >satellite</attribute>
<attribute name="Height" >2.48</attribute>
<attribute name="Modified" >2026-09-17T09:21:46-04:00</attribute>
<attribute name="Name" >TB ↔ Boris mapping</attribute>
<attribute name="Sentiment" >-0.51818183</attribute>
<attribute name="Sentiments" >-0.8;-0.2;-0.6;-0.6;-0.2;-0.2;-0.8;-0.2;-0.4;-0.8;0;-0.6;-0.8;-0.8;-0.8;-0.6;-0.8;0.2;-0.6;-0.6;-0.4;-0.8</attribute>
<attribute name="Tags" >mapping</attribute>
<attribute name="Width" >4</attribute>
<attribute name="Xpos" >22.5</attribute>
<attribute name="Ypos" >0</attribute>
<text >Working map (v0):

Tinderbox                     → Boris
-----------------------------   -----------------------------
Note ($Name)                  → title (+ path-derived or BorisId)
Outline parent                → parent: entity-id (Satellite)
Root / no parent              → Trunk
$Text                         → Markdown body (transformed)
Basic link (unnamed/named)    → [[wiki]] and/or relations:[kind=]
Text link                     → wiki-link or human_review
$Tags                         → tags: [...]
$URL                          → body link or dropped+reported
Prototype                     → usually scaffolding (unsupported as page)
Agent                         → unsupported (report)
Adornment                     → unsupported (report)
Alias                         → resolve to canonical id
Map Xpos/Ypos/Width/Height    → unsupported (geometry)
User attrs outside closed set → sidecar / body appendix / drop+report
$BorisId (user)               → id: (exact when valid)
$BorisParent (user)           → parent: (exact when valid)
$BorisStatus (user)           → status:
$ExportClass                  → lab-only projection hint</text>
<html ><![CDATA[<p>Working map (v0):</p>

<p>Tinderbox                     → Boris</p>
<p>-----------------------------   -----------------------------</p>
<p>Note ($Name)                  → title (+ path-derived or BorisId)</p>
<p>Outline parent                → parent: entity-id (Satellite)</p>
<p>Root / no parent              → Trunk</p>
<p>$Text                         → Markdown body (transformed)</p>
<p>Basic link (unnamed/named)    → [[wiki]] and/or relations:[kind=]</p>
<p>Text link                     → wiki-link or human_review</p>
<p>$Tags                         → tags: [...]</p>
<p>$URL                          → body link or dropped+reported</p>
<p>Prototype                     → usually scaffolding (unsupported as page)</p>
<p>Agent                         → unsupported (report)</p>
<p>Adornment                     → unsupported (report)</p>
<p>Alias                         → resolve to canonical id</p>
<p>Map Xpos/Ypos/Width/Height    → unsupported (geometry)</p>
<p>User attrs outside closed set → sidecar / body appendix / drop+report</p>
<p>$BorisId (user)               → id: (exact when valid)</p>
<p>$BorisParent (user)           → parent: (exact when valid)</p>
<p>$BorisStatus (user)           → status:</p>
<p>$ExportClass                  → lab-only projection hint</p>]]></html>
</item>
